---
import PlatformLayout from "../../layouts/PlatformLayout.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---
<PlatformLayout title="Downloads" description="Download Kéire Hub 0.3.1 and review validated platform support and release requirements." active="downloads">
    <section class="platform-section"><div class="platform-shell">
        <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Kéire Hub 0.3.1</p><h1>One entry point for projects, Editors, and packages.</h1></div><p>The Hub verifies signed release metadata, resumes bounded downloads, and keeps every installed Editor independent. Linux 0.3.1 remains gated until native package validation completes.</p></div>
        <div class="editorial-grid">
            <article id="windows" class="editorial-panel download-card" data-platform="windows"><span class="editorial-panel__index">W</span><h3>Windows</h3><p>Validated release target for Windows 10 and 11. The native installer registers Hub, deep links, and Editor management.</p><p class="form-message" data-download-state>Checking the signed stable catalog…</p><div class="download-variants" data-download-variants></div></article>
            <article id="linux" class="editorial-panel download-card" data-platform="linux"><span class="editorial-panel__index">L</span><h3>Linux</h3><p>Fedora and Ubuntu builds are under final 0.3.1 packaging validation. The site exposes only artifacts that pass the native install matrix.</p><p class="form-message" data-download-state>Checking release status…</p><div class="download-variants" data-download-variants></div></article>
            <article id="macos" class="editorial-panel download-card" data-platform="macos"><span class="editorial-panel__index">M</span><h3>macOS</h3><p>Source compatibility is maintained. Native validation, signing, and notarization are required before macOS is advertised.</p><p class="form-message" data-download-state>Checking release status…</p><div class="download-variants" data-download-variants></div></article>
            <article class="editorial-panel"><span class="editorial-panel__index">A</span><h3>Release archive</h3><p>Current stable downloads stay focused. Previous metadata remains auditable without crowding the primary download experience.</p><a class="button button--secondary" href="/downloads/archive/">Open release archive</a></article>
        </div>
    </div></section>
</PlatformLayout>
<script src="/assets/downloads.js" defer></script>
